*Missed Cues*

This actually happend to list member Nila Wilhem.  She writes, 

"Several years ago, we were rehearsing 'Little Women' for our Garland
Civic Theatre.

The older gentleman who was playing the father's part was wearing a
hearing aid.

We wondered why he kept missing his cues until we discovered that it was
not a hearing aid.

He was listening to a ball game."

